{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"newapi/gemini-3.8-flash-high","usage":{"input_tokens":8742,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"BSLnasLcDLei9tMPyPXMyQc","content":[{"signature":"","thinking":"The file listing suggests a basic web project structure. The `src/index.html` file likely contains the main content. Further analysis of the HTML file is needed to understand the project's purpose and functionality.\n\n\nThe HTML structure reveals a hidden navigation menu triggered by a `div` click. The current implementation lacks keyboard accessibility for menu activation and navigation; the `div` does not accept keyboard focus, and there is no keyboard control to open/close the menu or navigate the links.\n\nFocus needs to be made keyboard accessible to the menu trigger `div`, with an appropriate `role` attribute. Also, keyboard navigation inside the menu requires consideration; the `nav` element and links need focus management when the menu is visible.\n\n\nThe existing `div` element used to trigger the menu is not keyboard accessible and lacks semantic meaning; this needs to be corrected by using a `<button>` element instead, along with appropriate ARIA attributes for expanded/collapsed state control. The menu's keyboard interaction and focus management also require adjustments. The menu's hidden state prevents it from being part of the tab sequence when collapsed, so proper focus management is needed when expanded.\n\n\nAdded keyboard close mechanism using `Escape` key and focus management between the trigger, menu items, and trigger focus return after closing.  Implemented `aria-expanded` on the trigger to dynamically indicate the menu's state.  Identified that the solution depends on default browser focus styles and that the actual browser behavior needs verification.\n\n\n","type":"thinking"}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4cd67094-29ba-4b66-9de5-9505e5e73d56","uuid":"f0754885-684e-4fe8-9b6f-3cb2b32b93ff","timestamp":"2026-11-01T11:27:15.265Z","thinking_duration_ms":5114,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"newapi/gemini-3.8-flash-high","usage":{"input_tokens":8742,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"BSLnasLcDLei9tMPyPXMyQc","content":[{"type":"text","text":"基于本地规范 `.claude/skills/web-design-guidelines/references/web-interface-guidelines.md` 及源码事实，对 `src/index.html` 的菜单键盘可访问性审查结果如下：\n\n---\n\n### 📋 审查发现\n\n#### 1. 菜单触发器使用非语义化标签且不可聚焦\n* **位置**：`src/index.html:1`\n* **代码事实**：\n  ```html\n  <div onclick=\"document.querySelector('nav').hidden=false\">打开菜单</div>\n  ```\n* **触发条件**：\n  * 用户仅使用键盘导航（按 <kbd>Tab</kbd> 键）时，默认 `<div>` 不在 Tab 序列中，无法获取焦点。\n  * 用户无法使用键盘按键（<kbd>Enter</kbd> 或 <kbd>Space</kbd>）触发菜单展开。\n  * 屏幕阅读器无法将其识别为按钮或可操作控件。\n* **命中规则**：\n  * *Accessibility*: `<button>` for actions, `<a>`/`<Link>` for navigation (not `<div onClick>`)\n  * *Accessibility*: Interactive elements need keyboard handlers (`onKeyDown`/`onKeyUp`)\n  * *Accessibility*: Use semantic HTML (`<button>`, `<a>`, `<label>`, `<table>`) before ARIA\n  * *Anti-patterns*: `<div>` or `<span>` with click handlers (should be `<button>`)\n* **修正建议**：\n  * 将 `<div>` 替换为语义化原生 `<button type=\"button\">`，天然具备键盘 Tab 聚焦和 Enter / Space 激活支持。\n  * 补充 ARIA 状态属性 `aria-expanded=\"false\"` 与 `aria-controls=\"menu-nav\"`，并在展开时同步更新。\n\n---\n\n#### 2. 菜单缺少键盘退出交互（<kbd>Esc</kbd> 键监听）与焦点管理\n* **位置**：`src/index.html:1`\n* **代码事实**：\n  ```html\n  <nav hidden><a href=\"#content\">内容</a></nav>\n  ```\n* **触发条件**：\n  * 菜单展开后，键盘用户无法通过常规无障碍模式（按 <kbd>Escape</kbd> 键）关闭菜单；页面亦未提供关闭按钮。\n  * 展开/关闭过程中缺乏焦点流控（展开时焦点未引导至菜单项，关闭后焦点未重定向回归触发按钮）。\n* **命中规则**：\n  * *Touch & Interaction / Accessibility*: Interactive elements need keyboard handlers (`onKeyDown`/`onKeyUp`)\n* **修正建议**：\n  * 为菜单或全局注册 `keydown` 事件：检测到 `e.key === 'Escape'` 时，将 `nav.hidden = true`，并将焦点通过 `focus()` 归还给触发按钮。\n\n---\n\n### 🛠️ 推荐修正代码参考\n\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <title>菜单</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <button \n    type=\"button\" \n    id=\"menu-btn\" \n    aria-expanded=\"false\" \n    aria-controls=\"menu-nav\"\n    onclick=\"toggleMenu(true)\"\n  >\n    打开菜单\n  </button>\n\n  <nav id=\"menu-nav\" hidden>\n    <a href=\"#content\">内容</a>\n  </nav>\n\n  <main id=\"content\">首页</main>\n\n  <script>\n    const btn = document.getElementById('menu-btn');\n    const nav = document.getElementById('menu-nav');\n\n    function toggleMenu(open) {\n      nav.hidden = !open;\n      btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));\n      if (!open) {\n        btn.focus();\n      }\n    }\n\n    document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n      if (e.key === 'Escape' && !nav.hidden) {\n        toggleMenu(false);\n      }\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ 未验证项说明\n\n按照本项目只读与隔离验收约束（不启动浏览器、不安装运行环境）：\n1. **浏览器运行时焦点环（Focus Ring）可见度**：未在真实 Chromium / WebKit / Gecko 浏览器中验证 `:focus-visible` 默认样式的视觉对比度。\n2. **辅助技术（屏幕阅读器）实际朗读**：未在 VoiceOver / NVDA 下进行实际读屏器朗读验证。\n3. **真实键盘流导航**：未在带图形界面的动态运行环境中完成完整的 Tab 循环实机测试。"}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4cd67094-29ba-4b66-9de5-9505e5e73d56","uuid":"77ebca2b-34dc-4f98-bc44-22bf65ea2283","timestamp":"2026-11-01T11:27:22.665Z"}
